MPV (formerly Luma Player) is derived from mpvKt by abdallahmehiz and contributors.
Upstream: https://github.com/abdallahmehiz/mpvKt
Upstream commit: 01a93062dd73f642cbb0511f6a05f1fd344b36a9
Original source license: Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE).
Modifications: Luma branding, home interface, appearance settings and build pipeline.
Native mpv/FFmpeg components retain their own licenses; see upstream distribution.

Bundled support library sources: third_party/seeker (Apache-2.0), third_party/fsaf (Unlicense).
Each includes its license and pinned upstream provenance.

MPV 0.7 interface icons use selected Iconsax Outline/Broken artwork by Lusaxweb, under the original Iconsax custom license. See third_party/iconsax and bundled app assets.
Only the unchanged home-library folder artwork remains from Font Awesome Free 7.3.1, copyright Fonticons, Inc., CC BY 4.0, per the user's explicit preservation requirement. Its attribution/license are under third_party/folder-artwork and bundled app assets. The Font Awesome icon implementation and all other glyphs were removed.

