MPV 0.17 native pause correction
Uses io.github.abdallahmehiz:mpv-android-lib:0.1.9 with only the two ARM libmpv.so binaries rebuilt from matching upstream source revisions.
OpenSLES pause and callback audio-clock modifications are provided under the applicable GPL-2.0-or-later terms.
See third_party/mpv-pause for the patch, original copyright/license texts, checksum-pinned source inputs, binary provenance and build instructions.
Original JNI wrapper, FFmpeg shared libraries and other AAR contents retain their upstream licenses and remain unmodified.
